", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}]}, {"type": "DWS", "stimuli_ids": [], "id": 11, "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"selected": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02re7pdf01.pdf"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "How that company was using CBIS in previous years? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"coverimg": "enpe8n4le03ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: Alisha, were we doing the fundamental tasks to gain any share in the marketplace last month? Or once again we were losing money. We simply can&rsquo;t go on this way!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager</strong>: Yes, I was. However, the problem lies on this obsolete manual information system. You should do something about it!</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: I&rsquo;m not a technology expert. Have you got any ideas?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager</strong>: I&rsquo;m not an expert either, but I&rsquo;ve got some basic knowledge about Computer-Based Information Systems. I guess it may help.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: Okay, what is it?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager</strong>: In my previous job, the company used to manage business information with the CBIS.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: Was the business operation running well with it?</p>", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager: </strong>I think so. It is essentially an interconnected system that comprises the hardware which includes, microcomputers, printers, presentation screens, servers, etc.; the software which involves operating systems and application programs; the communications network, that is, fiber-optic cable, coaxial cable, twisted pair wires, servers, communications software, and so on; the data resources that include numeric, alphanumeric, image, audio, and text data and, finally, the people resources related to end users and information systems specialists, analysts, programmers, testers, etc.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: And how long was it working there?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager</strong>: As far as I know, it&rsquo;s still working. Most of the business areas were interconnected with that CBIS system. Thus, planning, decision-making, and controlling were easier to do.</p>", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "43000", "id": 1}, {"text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>General manager</strong>: What information does it provide?</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Marketing manager</strong>: Two kinds of information. The system is fed with data or unprocessed information and the output is useful or processed information mostly utilized for management purposes. The advantage is that end users can get real-time access to that information and databases don&rsquo;t need to be duplicated reducing time and cost at the same time.</p>", "image": "enpe8n4le03ob02re2img03.jpg", "time": "93500", "id": 2}], "audiosrc": "enpe8n4le03ob02re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "title": "", "_data": [], "id": 1, "template_override": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Computer Based information Systems, CBIS"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear/use to talk about Computer-Based Information Systems."}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Learning Outcome"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.  Recognizes simple ideas on the design of an information system, computer architecture and hardware, and basic concepts on graphic design."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "share"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a percentage of the total sales market of a product or category of products that rival companies can achieve"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Alisha, were we doing the fundamental tasks to gain any share in the marketplace last month?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lie on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to rest; to be caused by"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: However, the problem lies on this obsolete manual information system."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "comprise"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to consist of; to be composed of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is essentially an interconnected system that comprises the hardware."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "application program "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "any program designed to perform a specialized task"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The software which involves operating systems and application programs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "decision making"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a thoughtful process of deciding from a pool of options the best alternative to meet an intended objective"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Decision-making and controlling were easier to do"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "feed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to supply a machine or system with raw or processed information"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Two kinds of information, the system is fed with data or unprocessed information."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Past continuous in Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>The <strong>Past Continuous </strong>tense has several uses but, generally speaking, it refers to actions that were happening for some time in the past.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Alisha, were we doing the fundamental tasks to gain any share in the marketplace last month?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Was the business operation running well with it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "And how long was it working there?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p>The <strong>Past Continuous </strong>tense can be used in affirmative, negative, and <strong>interrogative</strong> forms. This structure can help you express ideas about a past action that took place at a specific time, about two actions that were happening at the same time, or about one action that was occurring before another one.</p> <p>In the interrogative form, you can use Wh- question words (what, how, why, when, etc.) + to ask for more specific information. Check the next chart:</p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"STRUCTURE\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"EXAMPLE\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Was/were + subject + verb + ing + complement + ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>Were you working in the project last night?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Wh-Question + was/were + subject + verb + ing + complement + ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<i>Who was explaining you the use of the new information system?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Types of Computers"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A computer is a programmable and electronic machine that has revolutionized our world due to its capability of accepting data, storing it for later usage, processing it at high speed, and transforming such data into utilitarian information in any subject, from science to business or education.&nbsp;</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It is essentially an interconnected system that comprises the hardware which includes, microcomputers, printers, presentation screens, servers, etc."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The communications network, that is, fiber-optic cable, coaxial cable, twisted pair wires, servers, communications software, and so on."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Computers are in constant evolution; however, there are some classifications that help to understand them in a better way. Such classification depends on variables like size, function, or usage.</p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Types Of Computers By Size</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Microcomputers:</strong> They have been developed for a non-particular use. Examples of microcomputers are laptops, desktops, tablets, in-car computers, smartphones, programmable calculators, and game consoles among the most important.&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Mainframe computers:</strong> these are robust computers used in large organizations for crucial applications that process massive data such as census, industry and consumer statistics, (ERP) enterprise resource planning, bank transaction processing, and government transaction processing.</p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Minicomputers:</strong> usually known as servers nowadays, these are computers that are larger than a microcomputer but smaller than a mainframe. They have customized features to meet clients&rsquo; needs for processing and storage capabilities.</p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Supercomputers:</strong> These are the most powerful computers in terms of data processing and performance developed for very specialized and complex tasks that require thousands of calculations at very reliable conditions. They have been used mostly in research and exploration purposes for NASA.</p>"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img01.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img02.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img03.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img04.jpg"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Mainframe Computer and Mini Computer "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The correct election for a computer to meet the need of handling a large amount of data is crucial. In that decision-making process, <strong>mainframes and microcomputers</strong> play an important role as optional alternatives.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It is essentially an interconnected system that comprises the hardware which includes, microcomputers, printers, presentation screens, servers, etc."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Mainframes</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align: justify;\">These are large computers used in large-sized companies such as banks, governmental agencies, or companies with subsidiaries along the country and overseas. The magnitude of data that companies of this size need to manage would be overwhelming if companies don&rsquo;t use computing equipment that is tailored to tasks and projects of this size. In addition, many functions are performed within this type of organizations, from design and product development to statistical data processing coming from marketing campaigns or accounting operations.</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Microcomputers</strong> They are machines for a more general purposeful use; laptops, desktops, in-car computers, and smartphones are just some examples of microcomputers. Though quick for built-in modern microprocessors, they are not as fast as the speed at which mainframe computers work. Microcomputers&rsquo; circuits tend to get warm and software tends to freeze when many programs are opened simultaneously. The system works even more slowly when interconnectivity is involved either by video conferencing or streaming.</p>"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img05.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "enpe8n4le03ob02img06.jpg"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Search for information about CBIS."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Identify the most relevant aspect of CBIS."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Search for information about any company that uses CBIS."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of questions to ask about how that company was using CBIS in previous years. Take into account the relevant aspects of CBIS and the company your searched for. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your list of questions with your class and discuss possible answers. "}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I search for information about CBIS. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify relevant aspects of CBIS. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I search for information about a company that uses CBIS. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of questions to ask about how that company was using CBIS in previous years."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share and discuss the questions. "}]}]}